# Intake NL-handling fix cycle 2 — re-run hardening — apply ladder

Cycle 2 of the intake natural-language-handling fix. The first
acceptance-smoke re-run
(`docs/experiments/loam-1.0-acceptance-smoke-rerun.md`) confirmed cycle 1
(amendment #164) landed Bug 3 (vacuum-routing for the clear cases) and
Bug 4 (role-noun) cleanly, but surfaced three residuals — all ladder to
the SAME four ACs (refinements, not new ACs):

  - AC.INTAKE-AFFIRM.1 — a confirm LEADING with a hedge interjection
    ("Ha, that's a mouthful — but yes, basically!") was routed to the
    correction branch because the first word-token was "ha".
    `_leading_polarity` now skips leading filler tokens and promotes an
    explicit agreement pivot ("but yes"); a bare affirmation word buried
    in "not sure" / "sort of" is NOT promoted (it stays a correction).
  - AC.INTAKE-ECHO.1 — (a) the proposal distillation grabbed a temporal
    preamble ("every single night I'm sitting at my kitchen table writing
    up listing") rather than the action. `_ACTION_PREAMBLE` drops the
    scene-setting and `_WANT_SPAN` extracts an explicit stated intent
    ("I want to stop writing those listing descriptions") so the action
    leads. (b) the CORRECTION branch echoed the raw reply into the seed +
    close; it now distills the correction too.
  - AC.INTAKE-VACUUM.1 — cycle 1's widened classifier over-fired: a
    day-derived reply ("I don't know, but the thing that eats my day is
    the write-ups") reached the deep-research ladder, breaking the
    featherlight invariant. A `_HARD_VACUUM` override ("nothing's broken
    / it's just constant" stays a vacuum) plus a `_DERIVABLE_PAIN`
    demotion (one concrete singled-out pain → PARTIAL, off the ladder)
    separate the claims-adjuster (PARTIAL, no research) from the paralegal
    (vacuum, opt-in research reachable).

Method-level choices (builder's call per ODD §1.1):

  - The distillation stays deterministic (clause/preamble/want-span
    heuristics). The report named an LLM-classify alternative; the
    deterministic path handles every observed transcript case and keeps
    the intake dependency-free. The residual judge findings on
    four-step-loop-ran / no-over-engineering are DEEPER intake-design
    surfaces beyond the four NL bugs (surfaced to the dispatcher, not
    silently widened).
  - The agreement-pivot promotion is intentionally narrow ("but yes" /
    "okay yes" …) so a buried "sure" in "not sure" never reads as a
    confirmation.

